WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.060
You moved abroad, you got a survival job,
you're paying your bills, but is that the

00:04.060 --> 00:08.240
whole plan? So many immigrants work
incredibly hard between rent, family

00:08.240 --> 00:09.880
responsibilities, and daily expenses.

00:10.120 --> 00:13.180
It can feel like there's no room to
think about, okay, what comes next?

00:13.940 --> 00:16.300
A better future starts with
asking different questions.

00:16.680 --> 00:17.720
What skills can I develop?

00:18.080 --> 00:19.580
What opportunities can I explore?

00:20.000 --> 00:21.100
Who can I learn from?

00:21.280 --> 00:25.380
This is why the Diaspora Wealth Network
is hosting a free webinar to discuss

00:25.380 --> 00:29.720
practical ways immigrants can
develop skills, ways they can explore

00:29.720 --> 00:34.320
opportunities and even make more informed
financial decisions, whether it's in the

00:34.320 --> 00:37.220
area of investment, whether it's in the
area of real estate, whether it's in the

00:37.220 --> 00:38.280
area of career progression.

00:38.620 --> 00:43.200
If you want a clearer path for what comes
next, register for our free webinar by

00:43.200 --> 00:46.820
using the registration link on the screen
to save your space or you could just send

00:46.820 --> 00:50.480
me a DM and ask me to send you a link
directly or you drop a comment and I will

00:50.480 --> 00:51.960
come to your DM and drop the link for you.

00:52.100 --> 00:54.332
I can't wait to see you guys.

00:54.332 --> 00:58.795
There's so much to explore, especially if
you're an immigrant living anywhere in the

00:58.795 --> 01:02.620
diaspora, be it Canada, UK, US,
Australia, Europe, this is for you.
